            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "那不是读取密钥。读取以 qsprk- 开头的密钥。提供者密钥 (qsppk-) 注册节点并且永远不会被 Rapid 保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That read key contains a line break or control character. Paste it as a single line." : {
